# Sajtmaskin separation

- Sajtagent is version 2 of selected proven ideas, not a fork or shared system.
- Sajtmaskin repositories and local checkouts are read-only reference unless
  the user explicitly places an exact resource in scope.
- Never modify Sajtmaskin as a side effect of Sajtagent work.
- Never share or reuse its database, auth, Vercel project, environment,
  secrets, MCP connection, runtime, or live dependency.
- Ask before opening a local Sajtmaskin checkout; prefer a scoped GitHub
  comparison when reference evidence is needed.
- Reuse only an inventoried behavior or asset whose assumptions still fit.
  Adapt it behind a Sajtagent-owned contract; never raw-merge a donor tree.
